  "description": "Defines the quality standards for controllers used in professional esports competitions.",
  "definition": "A controller with IRS > 8.0, JoyPrec > 9.0, DriftRes > 9.5, TrigRes \u2265 5, and HapStr > 8, offering precise inputs and reliable performance required for competitive play at the highest level."
}

